  QuestionTextEN: How does the Foucault pendulum move?
  QuestionTextES: "\xBFC\xF3mo se mueve el p\xE9ndulo de Foucault?"
  CorrectAnswerEN: "Its plane of oscillation rotates due to the Earth\u2019s movement"
  CorrectAnswerES: "Su plano de oscilaci\xF3n gira por el movimiento de la Tierra"
  IncorrectAnswer1EN: "It stops every 12 hours due to the Earth\u2019s magnetic field"
  IncorrectAnswer1ES: "Se detiene cada 12 horas por el campo magn\xE9tico terrestre "
  IncorrectAnswer2EN: "It oscillates according to the Sun\u2019s gravitational field"
  IncorrectAnswer2ES: "Oscila seg\xFAn el campo gravitacional del Sol "
  IncorrectAnswer3EN: It changes direction due to atmospheric winds
  IncorrectAnswer3ES: "Cambia de direcci\xF3n por los vientos atmosf\xE9ricos"
